@startuml ansispire-audit-selfheal-dataflow
title Audit + Self-Healing Data Flow — TARGET (as-designed)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

|Semaphore|
start
:task runs (any template)\nemits task events;
|Relay (relay.py)|
:cursor-based paginated pull\n/api/events  (heartbeat 60s,\nresumable across restarts);
:POST events;
|Sink (sink.py)|
:HTTP receiver (host 3310 / ctr 3010);
:append to **events.jsonl**\n(application-level append writer;\nnot cryptographically tamper-evident);
|Reactor (reactor.py v2.6)|
:tail events.jsonl;
if (event matches rules.json?) then (yes)
  if (per-rule cooldown elapsed?) then (yes)
    if (rule enabled?) then (yes)
      :resolve template_name → template_id;
      :authenticate with **Bearer token**\n(no plaintext admin);
      |Semaphore|
      :trigger remediation template\n(Task API);
      :run remediation playbook\n(e.g. disk_cleanup.yml;\ndb_failover.yml — placeholder/TASK-008);
      note right
        loop closes: the remediation run
        itself emits events → relay → sink,
        auditable end-to-end.
      end note
      stop
    else (no)
      |Reactor (reactor.py v2.6)|
      :skip (soft-disabled: enabled=false);
      stop
    endif
  else (no)
    |Reactor (reactor.py v2.6)|
    :suppress (in cooldown);
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  |Reactor (reactor.py v2.6)|
  :ignore (no rule);
  stop
endif
@enduml
